meta {
  name: 02 - Instructor Accounts
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  # Instructor Accounts & Account Tokens

  Manages persistent **Instructor Accounts** (identified by a normalized email and an Argon2id password hash, per ADR-0007).

  Signing up or signing in issues a 12-hour **Account Token** (`kind: "account"`), which is automatically saved into `{{accountToken}}` and `{{accountId}}` for use on Curriculum Pack management routes and Classroom Game creation.
}
